                            <Polygon POINTS="615 2024 615 2039 2388 2039 2388 2024 2388 1993 2336 1980 2334 1980 2332 1980 2299 1991 2263 1980 2260 1980 2258 1980 2180 1991 2156 1980 2154 1980 2152 1980 2150 1980 2122 1991 1875 1980 1873 1980 1806 1991 1743 1980 1741 1980 1739 1980 1715 1991 1663 1980 1661 1980 1658 1980 1637 1991 1609 1980 1606 1980 1604 1980 1424 1991 1373 1980 1370 1980 1368 1980 1327 1991 1117 1980 1115 1980 1113 1980 1076 1991 1004 1980 1002 1980 948 1991 909 1980 907 1980 905 1980 615 1991 615 2024"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="a narrow strip of land between the sea and the inner bay. Occasionally the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-158_l25" HPOS="615" VPOS="2048" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="58" BASELINE="617 2078 2386 2082" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
